 cosmology0 aNT$12000 (VCD)2 a百禾文化傳播有限公司 0a波:音波與電磁波 0a現代物理學和宇宙論 0a移動,作用力與引力 0a能量:工作與力量 0a光:光學與電力1 aLoten, Wendy  pCDVd330e2172lv.1  a中興bZ8GLcM005566d330e2172pCDVlv.1fLEESLzMMDm1500tCCL  a中興bZ8GLcM005567d330e2172pCDVlv.2fLEESLzMMDm1500tCCL  a中興bZ8GLcM005568d330e2172pCDVlv.3fLEESLzMMDm1500tCCL  a中興bZ8GLcM005569d330e2172pCDVlv.4fLEESLzMMDm1500tCCL  a中興bZ8GLcM005570d330e2172pCDVlv.5fLEESLzMMDm1500tCCL  a中興bZ8GLcM005571d330e2172pCDVlv.6fLEESLzMMDm1500tCCL8 822114243670007976bM60MCc3FM1kCDVh330i217202152cgm a2200457 i 99005263309010797620230731133432.0051209s2008    ch            |   v chi d  a(NCHU)005263309TOP02  d中興eCCR1 achiheng  ach  a330b41212ncsclt  a330b4121-22ncsclt  a0129684500a基礎物理學系列 =h[錄影資料]bPhysics Essential Series11aPhysics Essential Series  a公開播映版  a臺北市b百禾文化總代理c[民97;入館年]  a6張光碟b有聲, 彩色c4 3/4吋  a英語發音, 中英文字幕  a出版年依據入館年著錄0 a第一集,電:看不見的能量流--第二集,波動:能量的傳遞--第三集,光,透鏡,與雷射--第四集,運動:牛頓三大定律--第五集,熱與物質狀態變化--第六集,力與功:作用力的能量0 a新臺幣12000元 (MPEG)07a電力.2csht07a電流.2csht 0a電:看不見的能量流=Electricity: The Invisible River of Energy 0a熱與物質狀態變化=Heat and the Changing States of Matter 0a運動:牛頓三大定律=Motion: Newton's Three Laws 0a波動:能量的傳遞=Waves: Energy in Motion 0a力與功:作用力的能量=Force and Work: Energy in Action 0a光,透鏡,與雷射=Light, Lenses and Lasers  pCDVd330e4121-2lv.1  a中興bZ8GLcM005572d330e4121-2pCDVlv.1fLEESLzMMDm1500tCCL  a中興bZ8GLcM005573d330e4121-2pCDVlv.2fLEESLzMMDm1500tCCL  a中興bZ8GLcM005574d330e4121-2pCDVlv.3fLEESLzMMDm1500tCCL  a中興bZ8GLcM005575d330e4121-2pCDVlv.4fLEESLzMMDm1500tCCL  a中興bZ8GLcM005576d330e412-2pCDVlv.5fLEESLzMMDm1500tCCL  a中興bZ8GLcM005577d330e4121-2pCDVlv.6fLEESLzMMDm1500tCCL8 822114276680007976bM60MCc3FM1kCDVh330i4121-28 822114276700007976bM60MCc3FM1kCDVh330i412-201219cam a2200349 i 99005263415010797620230731133415.008101